{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13169","headline":"赋得荆溪夜湍送蒋逸人归义兴山 · 皇甫冉","name":"赋得荆溪夜湍送蒋逸人归义兴山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惊湍流不极，夜度识云岑。\n长带溪沙浅，时因山雨深。\n方同七里路，更遂五湖心。\n揭厉朝将夕，潺湲古至今。\n花源君若许，虽远亦相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}